<title>USA: Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freddie Mac revised short-term discount note rates Wednesday as follows:</p>
<p> -		 MATURITY--RATE</p>
<p> -		Overnight--5.00</p>
<p> -		Nov 18,19--5.30</p>
<p> -		Nov 20-29--5.23</p>
<p> -	    Dec 6,13,16--5.19</p>
<p> -		    Jan 7--5.18</p>
<p> -	   Feb 12,13,14--5.18</p>
</text>
